# Never upload local secrets or machine-local state.
# Git integration already skips these (they are in .gitignore), but a manual
# `vercel deploy` from this folder uploads the working tree and would
# otherwise have nothing stopping .env — which holds the live ADMIN_PASSWORD
# and PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY — from leaving the machine.
.env
.env.*
HANDOVER.md
.data/
.kilo/
.vercel/
node_modules/
.git/
